claudia-5gc: PacketRusher --release rel19 (shared codec libraries, Rel-18/19 capability + decoders)

This patch MODIFIES PacketRusher (https://github.com/HewlettPackard/PacketRusher, Apache License 2.0,
pinned at acf96b571dff4b58d9f33d66a8cfd48dd1500620). Per Apache-2.0 section 4(b) the files changed are
marked below; the patch itself is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later as part of claudia-5gc, the
modified PacketRusher files remain under Apache-2.0.

Changes:
  cmd/packetrusher.go                     new global flag --release rel17|rel19 (env PACKETRUSHER_RELEASE)
  internal/claudia/                       new package: release profile, Rel-18/19 5GMM capability bits,
                                          Registration Accept IE scan, NGAP DL decode, GTP-U PDU Set parser
  third_party/free5gc-nas/ie/5gmm_capability.go    Raw field (verbatim capability octets)
  third_party/free5gc-nas/message/message.go       PlainObserver hook (nil by default)
  .../mm_5gs/registration-request.go      capability IE through claudia.Capability5GMM() (rel17 = unchanged)
  .../gnb/ngap/service.go                 claudia.ObserveNGAP(payload) before Parse (no-op in rel17)
  go.mod / go.sum                         require+replace github.com/francurieses/claudia-5gc =>
                                          ./third_party/claudia-5gc (staged by scripts/packetrusher-vendor.sh)

